            <div xml:id="d67">

                <pb facs="0063" n="53" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg53"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890.00/7–2349: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Douglas</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-25T20:00:00-04:00">July 25, 1949—8 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2602. Plan indicated your 2910 satisfactory. It establishes idea of continuing
                    consultation and exchange of views which is what we desire.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
